  "description": "ARACUV crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C136 H176 Eu8 O92 Sn12. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu5 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu6 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu7 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu8 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.036-4.975 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.19-155.95°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C136H176Eu8O92Sn12. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 12 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
